5. Scope and priorities
• P0 (must work): auth, RBAC, employees, departments, role dashboards, attendance, leave, notifications.
• P1 (should work): payroll, documents, performance reviews, AI assistant and summaries, CSV reports, analytics, audit logs, announcements.
• P2 (if time allows): XLSX and PDF exports, forgot/reset password, bulk import, 3D accents, command palette, leave calendar polish.
