Each phase ends with passing lint, typecheck, tests and build, a browser check, and an updated project status document.
15. Out of scope for this release
Statutory payroll and tax rules, recruitment and onboarding workflows, expense management, shift scheduling, biometric/QR/GPS attendance, native mobile apps, multi-organization tenancy, SSO/SAML, and any automated employment decision.
16. Open questions
1. Should managers see attendance and leave only for direct reports, or for the whole reporting chain?
2. Should employees be allowed to upload their own documents, and in which categories?
3. Which leave types and yearly allowances should be seeded by default?
4. Is a custom domain available for production? It would simplify cookie handling and WebSockets.